WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:06.150
Lately, lots of people have been illegally downloading TV shows over the internet.

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:14.860
Without the rights owner's permission, distribution via bootlegs is illegal.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:18.540
Please remember that and thank you.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:27.710
Alesta?

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:29.090
Where am I...?

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:32.590
In your room. I brought you back.

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:36.050
I was surprised to see you like that; out for the count.

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:38.510
What were you doing hanging around out there?

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:40.890
If I hadn't seen you there, who knows what could've happened to you?

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.020
The least you can do is thank me!

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:44.980
What... is this?

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:48.570
Seems you're fine at the moment. I'll be going now.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:52.320
Take it easy then, buh-bye!

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:01.790
Udders

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:05.620
Udders

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:09.590
Plug!

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:17.590
Kiseki wa genjitsu no tonari ni aru

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:17.590
Miracles are right beside reality

00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:20.680
Kanarazu aru

00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:20.680
They're there for sure

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:32.030
Chiisana tameiki shinpai dakara

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:32.030
I heave a tiny sigh because I'm worried

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:37.950
Ushiro sugata mimamotteirunda yo

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:37.950
From behind you, I'm watching over you

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:43.910
Kirai dattara konna koto iwanai yo

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:43.910
I wouldn't be saying this if I hated you

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:50.080
Kitto hito wa hitori janai

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:50.080
I know it must be true that no man is an island

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:51.460
Hitori janai

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:51.460
You're not alone

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:57.760
Tatoeba sotto yubisaki ni fureru omoi

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:57.760
For example, if you gently brush those hopes with your fingertips

00:01:58.130 --> 00:02:03.680
Tatoeba taisetsu na toki wo wasurenaide

00:01:58.130 --> 00:02:03.680
For example, if you never forget these precious times

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:09.650
Kakato wo motto sukoshi dake takaku agete

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:09.650
I'll boost you up, just a little higher

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:15.610
Mieru yo ano ko no hitomi ni utsuru hikari

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:15.610
Look and see the light reflecting in her eyes

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:21.490
ENERGY wa sekai no zenbu ni michiteru

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:21.490
Filling up the whole world with energy

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:29.290
Ima dake wa chikara wo kashite ageru yo

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:29.290
Just for now, I'll lend my strength to you

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:48.560
Seems to have subsided a bit...

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:54.980
But back then, what exactly happened?

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:09.080
<i>No matter. The idea of him hitting me with a baseball bat in the parallel world...</i>

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:12.920
<i>...me, a Charging Lady who aspires for perfection...</i>

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:14.790
<i>...is just totally inconceivable!</i>

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:17.000
<i>Just recalling that incident...</i>

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:19.970
It infuriates me!

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:31.020
Lock on!

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:31.020
Lock on!

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:43.110
Morning, Alesta!

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:45.490
You're looking crisp today.

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:47.540
Aiming to be number one this month again?

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:49.250
Just doing my best.

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:51.830
H-How can this be?!

00:03:54.040 --> 00:04:00.210
NOTICE

00:03:54.040 --> 00:04:00.210
Charging Lady 2nd Class, Plug Cryostat

00:03:54.040 --> 00:04:00.210
The above personnel will have their salary
reduced by 10% for the next 3 months.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:04:00.210
Management Headquarters - General Affairs Section

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:56.590
What in the world did you do?

00:03:56.590 --> 00:04:00.210
I could understand if it were
just a month's cut, but three...

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:05.390
What am I going to do? I'll have to eat one less meal everyday from now.

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:07.010
What goes around comes around.

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:08.470
Alesta!

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:11.680
With that kind of work efficiency,
being punished is natural.

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:14.810
Don't tell me that...!

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:18.440
It was me who made the report
to the Captain, you misfit.

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:20.440
Alesta, is this your way of getting back at me?

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:22.820
That and a couple other things.

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:26.370
Do you understand our company's policy?

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:28.370
Lucky Charm

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:32.960
Waiting for the target's depression level to increase before charging is a violation.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:36.920
Based on that incident, firing you would be the norm.

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:45.090
B-But... you were with me back then too, why aren't you getting the heat as well?

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:47.600
That target was none of my business, anyway.

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:52.430
Besides, I wouldn't do something as frivolous as that.

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:57.100
Damn you!

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:57.100
Get a hold of yourself, Plug!

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:59.820
<i>Well, you should be punished after all.</i>

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:03.570
Charging Lady Second Class, Alesta Blanket.

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:05.950
Please report to the Second Class Captain's Office.

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:09.700
Charging Ladies Second Division Captain's Office

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:09.700
I'm holding you responsible for Plug's actions.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:13.910
You couldn't stop Plug back then.

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:16.000
But Captain, with all due respect...

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:18.130
Please, let me finish.

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:21.750
I have no intention of cutting your pay.

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:25.970
Alesta...

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:29.680
What do you think is the
difference between you and Plug?

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.640
Permission to speak freely, ma'am?

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:33.470
Permission granted.

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:37.440
Plug is an idiot, and I am talented.

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:41.860
That's rather blunt.

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:45.110
But, I do share your opinion.

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:47.410
Listen carefully to what I'm about to say, Alesta Blanket.

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:48.200
Roger.

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:51.660
I trust in your ability, and wish
to promote you to supervisor.

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:56.120
Just like you said, Plug is an idiot.

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.830
She might repeat her mistake again.

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:03.170
In order for her not botch up again, you are to supervise and guide her.

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:05.760
Because you're talented.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:19.600
Why do I have to be a nursemaid for that idiot...

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:23.570
How infuriating! That Plug!

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:28.110
How infuriating! That Alesta!

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:29.740
What's her deal?!

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:31.490
That arrogant bitch!

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:38.330
But, according to the company policy, Alesta is right.

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:43.670
I'm in for a change of scenery.

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:52.140
You look ravishing, Milly.

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:54.390
Don't!

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:56.100
Milly!

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:59.480
How does it feel to be touched by your own device?

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:03.690
Milly, don't lose to that sadistic witch!

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:05.020
What are you doing here?

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:06.780
Sorry for intruding.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:11.490
I… won't lose!

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:13.530
What are you doing here?

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:15.620
This episode is at its climax!

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:17.200
She's been caught by the enemy!

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:20.460
Just what the hell are you doing...?!

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:22.580
I won't hurt you.

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:24.420
No way! That thing is simply too big for Milly!

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:27.800
You think you can just barge in here?!

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:34.390
<i>Plug must be there, huh?</i>

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:37.560
<i>If that's the case, I'll just have to beat some sense into her. </i>

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:41.190
<i>If I don't do that, this will never end.</i>

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:43.190
Plug.

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:46.270
No, run away!

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:50.570
Long time no see.

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:54.740
<i>It's him!</i>

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:00.710
Are you all right?

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:03.620
That bastard...

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:13.680
I see, that guy got you too...

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:15.140
That guy?

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:17.470
How dare he hit me... twice.

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:21.890
That's right. With this, his weapon of choice...

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:24.190
Explanation:

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:26.980
When a Charging Lady's stealth
device is set to maximum...

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:29.650
...not only are they invisible to
humans of the parallel world...

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:31.860
...they are also unable to touch anything.

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:34.860
Thus, the hand passing through the bat is normal.

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:37.320
<i>Wait a second.</i>

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:43.120
<i>Then why can this baseball bat hit us?</i>

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:47.630
So you're awake.

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:54.470
Use this to get rid of the swelling.

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:55.380
Here you go.

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:01.720
Don't tell me... you can see me?

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:02.430
Yeah.

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:08.150
What's going on?

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:14.610
<i>Why is it that things he touches
can also be felt by us?!</i>

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:18.410
<i>Why? Is it our world's technological failure?</i>

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:21.580
<i>Or is it because he has a unique genetic make-up?</i>

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:23.830
I'm sorry for what happened.

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:28.170
The moment I felt a tingling at my back,
my body acted on reflex.

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:30.000
Just what's the meaning of this?!

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:32.760
Well...

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:37.430
What did you say?!

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:39.470
Alesta!

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:44.310
Why do you want to go back all of a sudden?

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:46.480
To report this.

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:47.690
Report?

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:50.860
Why haven't you reported this
crucial piece of information yet?!

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:52.530
This isn't something that should be overlooked!

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:57.530
What's all the fuss about?

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:00.490
Our stealth devices are set to maximum,

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:04.040
yet a human is still capable of seeing and touching us.

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:07.210
I must report this to my superiors in order for them to solve the problem.

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:10.960
Is it really that big a deal?

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:12.210
Of course it is!

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:17.170
I will also report that you have been hiding this instead of reporting it.

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:18.470
Seriously?!

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:20.850
Perhaps they'll determine whose fault it is.

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:23.680
This might entail more than a mere salary reduction.

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:25.560
No way...

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:26.310
Hold on.

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:29.980
You sure are an arrogant one.

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:32.150
This has nothing to do with you.

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:33.610
Perhaps.

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:39.070
But, when I see an arrogant prick, I get pissed.

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:41.620
Isn't there a nicer way to put it?

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:44.830
Are you referring to being "softer"?

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:46.120
Exactly.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:50.330
Someone who randomly hits people with baseball bats...

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:52.540
...is telling me to be softer on others?

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:54.590
Why you...!

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:55.960
Sentou!

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:57.840
Who the hell do you think you are?!

00:10:58.170 --> 00:10:59.930
A Charging Lady.

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:01.800
Right, you're just a Charging Lady!

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:03.760
Just...?

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:04.600
That's right.

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:08.730
Sticking a plug into any depressed target you see...

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:11.600
Even an idiot can do that!

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:13.360
Even an idiot...

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:16.070
Well, this idiot can do it.

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:17.690
Bastard!

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:20.240
That's not true, right, Alesta?

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:23.490
To associate me, who achieved the special award consecutively for three months,

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:29.330
and is aiming for the MVP of the year award, with Plug...

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:30.870
You damn bastard!

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:32.420
Interesting.

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:34.590
In that case, let's resolve this right here, right now!

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:38.590
If I win, you can't report to the higher-ups about Plug.

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:40.420
If you win, you can do as you wish.

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:44.090
Sentou, you're fighting for me?

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:45.470
In your dreams!

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:48.470
All I want to do is to humiliate this bitch.

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:54.270
I agree, let's have a battle to resolve this.

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:59.530
But, we won't use fighting to decide victory.

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:02.740
I'll choose the method.

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:08.450
Don't screw this up, you swine!

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:16.710
How's this?

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:21.970
Charging Target Search Battle!

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:24.430
Competition time limit: two hours.

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:26.180
Vicinity: up to you.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:31.180
Victory shall be awarded to the
one with the most targets located.

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:34.060
With that said...

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:36.690
Alesta, isn't that a little unfair?

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:40.360
Sentou has no idea how to locate a charging target.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:43.740
But didn't he say that even an idiot could do it?

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:46.450
Plug, don't mind her, I'll definitely win.

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:52.450
<i>Still acting as though finding targets will be simple.</i>

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:54.500
<i>It will be I who will win this, for sure.</i>

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:55.960
Oh yeah, Alesta.

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:58.130
You gotta switch off the auto-detector.

00:12:58.130 --> 00:12:59.550
That's right.

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:01.420
Auto-detector?

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:06.800
It automatically detects targets
with high depression levels.

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:09.010
But I didn't get one installed.

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:10.010
Why's that?

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:15.560
Plug's an idiot, that's why.
It was taken away from her.

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:18.060
That way she can't rely too
much on the device's capability.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:19.730
No...!

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:22.070
You really are useless...

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:24.820
Then, let's start.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:25.950
Yeah.

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:28.490
Ready, go!

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:35.660
<i>Even without the auto-detector's capabilities,</i>

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:37.290
<i>the opponent is only an amateur.</i>

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:38.500
<i>This will be a cinch.</i>

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:44.420
Do your best, Sentou!

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:52.810
With this many people,
I'm sure to find one real quick!

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:57.230
According to Plug's explanation, I use it like this?

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:01.020
<i>Whoa! Amazing.</i>

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:03.480
<i>Like this, I can see everything in a glance.</i>

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:06.820
<i>But...</i>

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:10.910
<i>Plug said the target should be an A, a B or a C. </i>

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:13.330
<i>The font shown will be red.</i>

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:16.410
<i>But I don't see any.</i>

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.760
Found one! Lock on!

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:26.550
I'm on a good start.

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:47.950
Damn, looking one-by-one like this...

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:49.660
Even more time won't help!

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:51.700
Wait.

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:58.290
I've been relying on this from the start till now.

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:02.290
<i>How did Hakone act back then...?</i>

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:06.670
If she were in front of me, she wouldn't exhibit any signs of depression.

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:10.800
<i>But that's only on the outside.
On the inside is where she's actually...</i>

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:14.010
<i>Then, if I observe carefully I might be able to…</i>

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:32.030
There are surprisingly few.

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:35.030
<i>At this rate, it might really be troublesome.</i>

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:36.870
<i>Don't fret.</i>

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:40.000
<i>During the solo training,</i>

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:42.250
<i>we also didn't have the auto-detectors on.</i>

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:43.830
<i>I did well without them.</i>

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:52.300
<i>Recall the basics that were taught at the training center.</i>

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:54.340
<i>And based on that...</i>

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:56.640
<i>Good!</i>

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:04.980
<i>Good!</i>

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:13.030
<i>Found one!</i>

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:27.840
Now announcing the results!

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:34.720
Well, it's 8 against 6.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:37.470
Winner: Sentou Oumi!

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:38.930
Yes!

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:41.850
How can this be...?

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:44.650
But Sentou, that's amazing!

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:47.400
And it was even your first time looking for targets.

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:48.820
I'm pretty capable, after all.

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:49.980
I can't accept that!

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:52.150
You must have cheated somehow.

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:54.950
Otherwise, how could an amateur defeat me?!

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:57.120
I didn't cheat.

00:16:57.120 --> 00:17:00.290
It's just that I wouldn't have found any using this.

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.540
What do you mean?

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:05.420
I'm not really used to this device.

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:06.420
So I might as well...

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:11.210
...trust my own eyes and use them to find what I'm looking for faster.

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:15.510
First, observe the target's expression.

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.590
Then look deep into their eyes.

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:22.100
That's...

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:23.890
What's wrong?

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:27.440
That's what we were taught in training.

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:30.230
First step: observe the target's behavior.

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:33.740
Next, don't be distracted by their expression, look deeply into the target's eyes.

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:36.610
Sentou, you clearly didn't learn
this kind of thing in training!

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:39.700
And it's hard to pull off even after learning it.

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:42.290
But, to actually do it is an amazing feat!

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:43.160
It can't be.

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:47.620
To pull that off...

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:48.880
Lies... you're lying.

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:51.750
To think that I actually...

00:17:54.170 --> 00:18:01.220
It's a lie! I couldn't have lost!

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:07.190
Alesta... broke down.

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:11.440
Don't think you've won just yet!

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:16.530
What?

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:19.360
So those are your true colors.

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:21.530
You do have a cute side, surprisingly.

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:23.410
C-Cu...?!

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:28.420
Today, it's only because of
not using the auto-detector...

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:30.380
...that you got flustered and
didn't know what to do, right?

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:32.670
Let's go at it again, fairly, next time.

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:36.470
Is that a promise?

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:37.470
Yeah!

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:47.890
Hey, hey, what's with the sudden
romantic mood going on?

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:53.940
When we get back, I'll have
everybody take a look at this.

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:56.990
Hey! Give me that image data!

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:58.490
Sure, a copy of it.

00:18:58.490 --> 00:19:01.070
You... you little...!

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:02.370
Hand it over!

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:03.410
No way!

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:07.120
Stop arguing over something so stupid.

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:08.460
Hurry up and get to work.

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:17.050
Like I said, stop already.

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:25.350
Don't make me repeat myself.

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:26.470
Stop this...

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:30.520
What part of "stop" don't you get?!

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:31.730
That goes for you, too!

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:36.070
Listen to others when they're talking, idiot!

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:39.030
<i>This is... so strange.</i>

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:41.450
<i>Being hit with this guy's baseball bat...</i>

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:44.530
<i>It just feels so good...!</i>

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:04.850
Awake already?

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:05.350
Plug.

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:08.430
Sentou really shows no mercy, huh?

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:10.850
You've been out cold for three hours now.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:12.640
Where?!

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:14.100
In the yard.

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:16.610
Is that so?

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:19.610
<i>That's strange...</i>

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:24.530
For a moment, I thought I was
being taken care of in his room.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:30.250
By the way, about the situation...

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:31.500
Situation?

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:35.500
Oh, yeah. I won't report anything to our superiors.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:36.500
Awesome!

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:41.970
In return, if there's any change in him, you are to report to me straight away.

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:43.220
Sure!

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:45.970
Then, let's go do our job.

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:49.930
We still need to charge the targets
that we found during the contest!

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:53.230
Somehow, it feels like she's refreshingly energetic.

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:57.020
Hey, wait for me!

00:20:58.270 --> 00:21:00.650
<i>Sentou Oumi, huh?</i>

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:05.450
<i>You're an interesting existence.</i>

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:15.460
Not good. I'm suddenly getting weird vibes.

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:17.790
Is it my imagination?

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:26.010
<i>Senny, I wonder which suits you better?</i>

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:30.680
Okay, this will do!

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:37.020
Honto wa totemo TOUGH nan da yo

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:37.020
Really, I'm quite tough, you know

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:39.820
Hitori demo heiki de

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:39.820
I'm fine even all by myself

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:42.570
Doko ni demo ikeru no

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:42.570
I can go anywhere at all

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:45.360
Koibito nante iranai

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:45.360
I don't need a boyfriend or anything

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:50.830
Takumashiku ikiteikunda to kimetetanda

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:50.830
I decided that I would live strong

00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:52.620
Kimi to deau made wa

00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:52.620
Until the day I could meet you

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:00.630
Sore wa arigachi na

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:00.630
"That really is

00:22:00.630 --> 00:22:03.420
Warui kuse da yo

00:22:00.630 --> 00:22:03.420
It's a bad habit

00:22:03.420 --> 00:22:06.170
Hanashi janai ka? nante

00:22:03.420 --> 00:22:06.170
such an often-heard saying, right?"

00:22:06.170 --> 00:22:08.970
Toshiue buranaide ne

00:22:06.170 --> 00:22:08.970
Don't pretend to be older than you are

00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:14.140
Datte ne watashi wa itsumo tokubetsu

00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:14.140
But you know, I'm always an exceptional case

00:22:14.520 --> 00:22:17.270
Kimi ni mo kitto SPECIAL deshou

00:22:14.520 --> 00:22:17.270
I'm sure I'm special to you, too

00:22:17.270 --> 00:22:18.980
Sore de nakya iya

00:22:17.270 --> 00:22:18.980
I couldn't stand it any other way

00:22:19.350 --> 00:22:22.820
Zettai watashi soba ni iru yo

00:22:19.350 --> 00:22:22.820
I'll definitely always be beside you

00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:30.820
Kimi ga ochikondara namida fusegu kasa ni naritainda yo

00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:26.950
I want to become the umbrella

00:22:26.950 --> 00:22:30.820
that shields you from tears when you're feeling down

00:22:31.160 --> 00:22:36.410
Keredo mamoreteru no wa naze ka watashi bakari

00:22:31.160 --> 00:22:33.790
But why is it that I'm the one

00:22:33.790 --> 00:22:36.410
who always ends up being protected?

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:42.710
Kimochi no naka no koishi ne tsumazuite korobisou na toki

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:42.710
At the times when, in my heart, I stumble and seem about to fall

00:22:42.920 --> 00:22:47.420
Itsumo sotto sasaete kureru

00:22:42.920 --> 00:22:47.420
Keep supporting me just a little, always

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:51.930
Futoshita kizuna itoshii yo

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:51.930
I'll treasure this unexpected bond

00:22:51.930 --> 00:22:53.260
Itsumademo

00:22:51.930 --> 00:22:53.260
Now and forever

00:22:53.680 --> 00:22:57.520
Eien Sweetheart

00:22:53.680 --> 00:22:57.520
Eternally, Sweetheart

00:23:05.980 --> 00:23:08.320
"Even though it hurts a lot at first..."

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:10.990
"...it starts to feel better eventually," they say.

00:23:10.990 --> 00:23:12.320
Is that really true?

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:19.790
<i>That kind of burst of ecstasy, one more time!</i>

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:26.840
I'm going to do it.

00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:34.720
It still hurts...

00:23:37.970 --> 00:23:39.430
Plug, come here for a sec.

00:23:40.100 --> 00:23:42.150
Alesta, what's up?

00:23:48.280 --> 00:23:49.490
That's overkill!

00:23:50.280 --> 00:23:52.240
Hey, how does it feel?

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:53.370
Does it feel good?

00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:57.620
Hey, how long are you going to lie down there?

00:23:57.620 --> 00:23:58.910
Get up now!

00:23:59.700 --> 00:24:03.000
Murder!

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:07.550
I won't forgive you, Sentou Oumi!

00:24:07.550 --> 00:24:09.380
Hitting me like that!

00:24:09.380 --> 00:24:11.510
That kind of impact, just by recalling it, I...

00:24:11.510 --> 00:24:13.260
Just by recalling it, I...

00:24:15.510 --> 00:24:17.760
Alesta, why are you moaning by yourself?

00:24:17.760 --> 00:24:19.100
That's not it!

00:24:19.100 --> 00:24:21.940
I do NOT fantasize about weird
stuff when I think of that guy!

00:24:21.940 --> 00:24:25.270
Here we have a perfect example of a
"delayed denial reaction" from Alesta.

00:24:25.270 --> 00:24:27.650
On the next episode of
Fight In one Strike! Charging Ladies!!:

00:24:27.480 --> 00:24:34.610
Iono, crisis!

00:24:27.650 --> 00:24:29.110
Iono, crisis!

00:24:29.110 --> 00:24:30.360
What will happen to Iono?!

00:24:30.360 --> 00:24:32.030
And what sort of wild thoughts will Alesta have?

00:24:32.030 --> 00:24:34.570
As if I'll have any!
